{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Example: DC machines",
  "exampleId": "block-dc-machines",
  "description": "All three have the same nominal point: 100 V, 100 A, 149.2 rad/s. The permanent-magnet and shunt machines run unloaded, so they speed up until their back EMF almost equals the supply: 100 V over a machine constant of 0.637 V·s/rad is 157 rad/s. The series machine would run away unloaded, so it drives a damper sized for its nominal torque and settles at its nominal speed.",
